Package: qemu-raspi4
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: qemu-system-aarch64-raspi4
Description: QEMU aarch64 system emulator with Raspberry Pi 4 board fixes
 A single-target (aarch64-softmmu) build of QEMU carrying Raspberry Pi 4
 (raspi4b / BCM2838) board-emulation fixes not yet in upstream or distro QEMU:
 .
  * BCM2838 GENET Ethernet model fixes (incl. TX ring-enable), so the on-board
    NIC works under emulation.
  * SD card routed to the emmc2 controller, so emmc2-only guests see the SD.
 .
 Built from the razr/qemu fork (branch genet-rebased-sd). Installed under
 /opt/qemu-raspi4 with a qemu-system-aarch64-raspi4 symlink on PATH, so it does
 not shadow the distro's own qemu-system-aarch64. These are board-emulation
 fixes, not guest-OS specific.
